{"reviewId": "34835833_85OnZq7lK", "review": {"abstract": "康波从萧条向回升的转换本质上就是从滞胀向通缩的转换，此时经济增速不断下降，商品价格明显回落，通缩成为社会的共识，这个过程也有10年之久。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "钱难挣已经成为社会的共识，名义gdp还在增长，出口创历史新高，高层定调2026为扩大内需之年……如果内需的作用能够平衡，甚至替代出口的作用，那么就扭转了，钱难挣的社会预期，也就降低了出口对gdp的拉动作用，外围的不可控因素对内在的经济扰动就会小很多，有利于处置国家内部的地缘政治风险…", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "4712-4780", "createTime": 1767190909, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "34835833_85OnZq7lK", "userVid": 34835833, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 34835833, "name": "治历明时", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTIBs9UBeP1ywb8PtGZHQzCxaicDoVhAgxM9hDTelcja4m4ODTm6KwAk233FkymZul4pF7M0CKojKIQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "你会好好的", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-1000", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 275579805, "name": "LeBron", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0004-zlMsJiX0WzYDno7oemcQue5/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "LeBron", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 6, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "每月除了公司发工资，国家也应该拿点出来